From e30fb83b6b444d5da2ee3b28b310791f7124f32b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (patch)" <sandarbh1-collab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:59:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix push notification service worker scope collision

- Merge push/notificationclick handlers from push-sw.js into the main
  service-worker.js. Both were previously registered at the default
  scope ('/'), which caused the two registrations to collide and made
  push delivery unreliable depending on load timing.
- Comment out registerPushSW() call in index.js instead of removing it,
  and leave push-sw.js in place, for future reference.
- Update pushService.js's getPushRegistration() to match against
  service-worker.js instead of push-sw.js.
- Fix manifest.json icon 'sizes' values (192X192/512X512 -> 192x192/512x512)
  to match the web app manifest spec.
---
 frontend/public/manifest.json             |  4 +--
 frontend/public/push-sw.js                |  6 ++++
 frontend/src/index.js                     |  9 ++++-
 frontend/src/service-worker.js            | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 frontend/src/serviceWorkerRegistration.js |  6 ++++
 frontend/src/services/pushService.js      |  5 ++-
 6 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

